WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.464
Identify good manners and why communities value them.

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:08.643
Good manners include greeting people, speaking courteously, being honest, respecting

00:00:08.643 --> 00:00:13.874
others and showing tolerance. They make relationships peaceful and help people feel

00:00:13.874 --> 00:00:14.310
welcome.

00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:19.933
Societal values also encourage responsibility, hard work and patriotism. We can

00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:24.311
practise good manners every day with both friends and strangers.

00:00:25.117 --> 00:00:29.682
Make a class good-manners chart and role-play greeting, apologising and thanking.
